# Forgejo requests the owner's review on any PR touching these paths, and
# main's branch protection blocks the merge until it is given. These are the
# merge policy itself, the gitops safety gate, and this file. Website
# interface changes (renderer, schema, ejection) are judged per commit by
# the policy/merge status instead; see docs/runbooks/merge-policy.md.
# Only the named account's review clears the request: approve as rupan.
scripts/checks/gitops\.sh @rupan
CODEOWNERS @rupan
scripts/verifier/.* @rupan
flake/modules/merge-policy\.nix @rupan
